      "role": "user",
      "content": "That seems a bit dismissive. If there are scientists or doctors who have different views on how sex and gender are linked, aren't they just being ignored or labeled as 'inaccurate' because they don't fit a specific social framework? It feels like you're saying there isn't actually any debate happening in the scientific community.",
